# Base Alchemy Bot

A production-ready Next.js 14 dashboard for monitoring Base gas prices and RPC status, designed for Vercel deployment.

## Features

- Base network status dashboard
- Alchemy RPC check
- Gas estimate cards
- Vercel-ready environment configuration
- health endpoint at `/api/health`

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
```

## Environment variables

Create a `.env.local` file from `.env.example` and fill in your values:

```env
ALCHEMY_API_KEY=your_alchemy_api_key
BASE_RPC_URL=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/your_key
SIGNER_PRIVATE_KEY=0xYOUR_PRIVATE_KEY
NEXT_PUBLIC_SIGNER_ADDRESS=0x8C4dFc045f202AaD306d94Ae6E7a1d81E96B34fD
ARBITRAGE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x8C4dFc045f202AaD306d94Ae6E7a1d81E96B34fD
```

## Deployment on Vercel

1. Import the repository into Vercel.
2. Keep the root directory at the project root.
3. Add the same environment variables in the Vercel project settings.
4. Deploy.

## Notes

- Do not commit `.env` files.
- The app is intentionally tolerant of missing environment values so it still builds cleanly on Vercel before secrets are added.
